48301d32eab72d2f61bd417d53b0204.avif?t=1753909650\" width=624 height=92 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/ecce933098c3becd8cf04c805acbdf3e.poster.avif?t=1753909650\" width=624 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/ecce933098c3becd8cf04c805acbdf3e.webm?t=1753909650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 stackable relics that can enhance, corrupt, or completely transform your playstyle. Synergies are key\u2014experiment or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/994fbd8885c267f8846c965b426543df.avif?t=1753909650\" width=624 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/cf20e6afe1ac18246ba1ee711ada1b71.poster.avif?t=1753909650\" width=624 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/cf20e6afe1ac18246ba1ee711ada1b71.webm?t=1753909650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the forgebound blacksmith between runs to upgrade your arsenal, re-roll your relics, or enhance upcoming pinball chambers with new hazards, rewards, or branching effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715690/extras/e3f3d74fa370bae22a424dce8fce7c72.avif?t=1753909650\" width=624 height=92 /